==Battleground==
*1 [[Hackey]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Henry]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Croakley]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Kid Tappa]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Ribbo]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] and [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Titan Cat]] are the way to go; the only other thing you need is the [[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast]] cannon or any other way to break barriers. Use all first 5 slots for [[Cat Combo|combos]] (mainly speed), as you don't need much variety in your Cats.

If you have [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Cutter Cat]], send him to knock back Hackey first, then send [[Green Shell Cat]] to stall and spam Catellite. The enemies won't be able to move an inch forward.

With full [[anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], [[Le'Solar]] has a mere 40,000 HP and around 4,000 Damage, so just stall using Catellite until you can spawn [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]], then as long as Henry, Hackey or Croakley don't hit Bahamut, he'll solo the stage and win. This becomes even more simple if you have Bahamut with [[Explosion]] Talents.

